abstract: "A bilingual (English and Chinese) reading companion to the talk Studying the Human Mind with AI: a start page, a guide to each of the talk's four parts, 22 one-page cards on key readings, a glossary, a reading path, a field-wide list of checked references, a guide to working with AI researchers, and a printable handout."
